=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kqw5oAeT6m4Q7kNvwFsA7VP&_nc_oc=AdmlIxrcF1Pq0L5vIrz0-OUZn4dbPV0spXm8vGvwVhPJoxUv66eKSNvCQF5dbH3XBxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzuCVK7qou6L2FABxFV2CW877crZ824H7d3xEl7Bva8qw&oe=69B93854"}, "display_name": "BTI: VR Training", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Key Features:\n\nHands-On Learning: Enhance your hands-on experience with a realistic virtual lab setting, ideal for BTI\u2019s BioSTART and Laboratory Associates Program.\n\nSelf-Paced Learning: Progress through learning modules at your own pace with built-in evaluations, ensuring you develop competencies before advancing.\n\nHaptic Feedback: Feel like you're performing real tasks with tactile feedback from the controllers.\n\nInstructor Monitoring: Instructors can track your progress and practice frequency, ensuring a smooth transition from virtual to real-world competency.\n\nAccessibility: Break down traditional barriers to training, providing more opportunities for underrepresented demographics.\n\nAdult Learning Principles: The program aligns with the principles of adult learning for effective skill development.", "short_description": "BTI VR Training is a cutting-edge training tool for the biotechnical sector, ideal for those entering the biotech industry. It combines practical lab simulations with interactive theoretical lessons, providing a comprehensive learning experience. This application is a key resource for acquiring essential lab skills, serving as a bridge to the dynamic biotech world."}]}, "developer_name": "Capitol Interactive LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.virtualapprentice.net/privacy-policy/new-portfolio-item-jjw66", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Apprentice LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://btiworks.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_c